  "description": "And some thoughts about Silver pushing upwards...",
  "body_html": "<p>If you only recently started following me, I was previously known as “CryptoWeatherMan.” My first viral videos were me being bearish and selling off most crypto in 2021, making a healthy profit after the 2019 investments. The hate comments made the videos go viral. LOL. Then 2022 came along. OOOOF. </p><p>I stuck around long enough in crypto just to get my early followers into a profitable position in the melt-up, but left crypto entirely late 2023. Too many risks with brokers, scammers, imposters and even the tokens themselves…it was no longer a minefield I wanted to navigate. Its easier to make money in Stocks than it was crypto.</p><p>For months I have said to stay away from crypto, for 1 simple reason: If Bitcoin price action is below the 200 day moving average: STAY AWAY. From Bitcoin and all altcoins. You do NOT need to catch the bottom. Or worse… dollar cost average 🤮. </p><h4><em>That changed today…</em></h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Just like Jim Cramer was bearish in 2023, acting as a catalyst for the Bitcoin breakout, he did it again! Ha!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png\" width=\"1417\" height=\"862\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:862,&quot;width&quot;:1417,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:233109,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/212014045?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zeuv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2a21523f-604d-4559-b49b-cddec5dc99d9_1417x862.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>There is no guarantee this holds…there are never any guarantees, no one, including me, has a crystal ball. <strong>However I think odds are in your favor that trend is changing, and with price breaking above the 200 day moving average, this is a great low risk entry area</strong>. If I was still trading crypto, this would be where I enter with an initial position, with a stop near the lows. If price action continues trending upwards, we can build the position over time. We DCA up, not down. Kind of like the Specific Entry Point Analysis (SEPA) we do with volatility contraction patterns, just for bottom situations. Develop a plan if you want to pursue this asset. If you have questions, feel free to swing by the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/8aac3321-fed7-4dd4-a536-a9fb92d3e2bb\">Main Chat</a>. </strong></p><p>The traditional markets have just been ranging around this week, after hitting all time highs last Thursday. Pretty boring, but I do not expect that “boring” to last forever. So stick around! </p><p>Most of my attention is on Silver right now. Not that I like to call bottoms…but I think we may have with the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/is-this-rally-finally-real\">July 31<sup>st</sup> Post</a>. Silver continues trending up. In that analysis, I compared Silver to many of the altcoins from crypto back in 2021, in which they had a 2nd macro wave upwards. I own silver mining stocks, because if gold rallies, likely so will silver, and likely so will silver miners…in which the miners will have the <em><strong>biggest % move </strong></em>upwards. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dgqF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d894acc-21ce-4804-8c92-c93b79425c97_1415x868.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dgqF!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d894acc-21ce-4804-8c92-c93b79425c97_1415x868.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dgqF!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d894acc-21ce-4804-8c92-c93b79425c97_1415x868.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dgqF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d894acc-21ce-4804-8c92-c93b79425c97_1415x868.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dgqF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d894acc-21ce-4804-8c92-c93b79425c97_1415x868.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dgqF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3d894acc-21ce-4804-8c92-c93b79425c97_1415x868.png\" width=\"1415\" height=\"868\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3d894acc-21ce-4804-8c92-c93b79425c97_1415x868.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:868,&quot;width&quot;:1415,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:343796,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quo